<title>GREECE: TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP WIDENS TO 401 BPS, 303 VS BT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP WIDENS TO 401 BPS, 303 VS BT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread between Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened to 401 basis points on Tuesday from Monday's 396.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also grew to 303 basis points from 300 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.66%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.65%	401	396 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.58%	408	404 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.63%	303	300 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.35%	331	329 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.28%	338	332 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.17%	249	246 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.45%	321	319 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0910 GMT. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
